  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting(7)': the Objective, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement, Swamp (posted 'Yavin 4 Swamp') and Yavin 4; these count toward the 60 (total 60 as published). Several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement is listed twice (once under Starting, once under Effects); both kept as posted. The strategy says the third starting Effect depends on the opponent, with this one as the default.",
  "Posted 'Yavin 4 Swamp' dested the Special Edition generic site Swamp (no Yavin 4 swamp site exists); 'I Have a Bad Feeling About this' (a Light card name) dested the Dark Dagobah Effect Bad Feeling Have I (the author's later version, DeckTech 14304, lists it as Bad Feeling Have I); 'Captain Gilead Pealleon' dested Captain Gilad Pellaeon; 'Hoth Ice Plains' Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker); 'Dagobah Cave' Dagobah: Cave; 'Executor Docking Bay' Executor: Docking Bay.",
  "Interrupts header says 10 but 9 are listed; total still 60. Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser is the Official Tournament Sealed Deck starship.",
  "Same title as the author's later revised list (DeckTech 14304, 6 March 2001, already live as [[Mason Johnson New Age Imperial Occupation]]); the two lists differ by several cards, so this earlier post gets its own page title."
